    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d119-a1">

                <pb facs="0209" n="943" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg943"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Governor McIntire to Mr. Uhl.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Denver, Colo.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-03-17"><hi rendition="#italic">March 17,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram received. Proper district attorney assures me he will use every
                    means to arrest and convict guilty. I have issued proclamation offering reward
                    of $1,000, the limit under our statutes, for apprehension and conviction of all
                    or any.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Albert W. McIntire</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Governor.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
